<title>UK: Entergy has 71 pct of London Electric.</title>
<headline>Entergy has 71 pct of London Electric.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Entergy Power UK Plc, the British unit of U.S. energy group Entergy Corp, said on Monday it had received valid acceptances representing 71.1 percent of the issued share capital of London Electricity Plc.</p>
<p>Entergy, which launched its recommended 1.267 billion stg bid for London Electricity in December last year, said it had extended the offer to February 14.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
